  "details": "I think adding badges could be a very fun way for users to show off things that they have accomplished or have done in vrchat. \nBadges can be awarded for things such as:\n-Attending events such as big raves or conventions \n-Having successful published worlds\n-Having X amount of playtime\n-Being a long time player\nThe strongest part of this badge system is that it would encourage players to attend events as well as allow for event hosts to work with the VRC team to get their event endorsed and to have their badges in the game. The collecting of badges from events also help players keep track of all of the cool things they've attended.\nBadges should be a special thing to award veteran players and encourage people to create and do more with the platform.\n(I also really like profile customization and im sure a lot of other people do too.)",
